156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are in month three of "Discover Your Home," with some Survey Results discussing City Goals. The new city website is live, and the updates are aimed at fostering community engagement and connection. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A recent survey was conducted among residents to identify key goals and priorities, which will guide the city council in setting objectives for the year ahead. The survey results have provided valuable insights into the top priorities of residents, enabling the city council and staff to better inform, prioritize, and plan for the future. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Here are the top five priorities that emerged from the community  survey in Question 1 \(See some results for question one here\):)
/E (Here are the top five priorities that emerged from the community  survey in Question 1 \(See some results for question one here\):)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1. Implementing Proactive Parking Measures: Addressing the diverse parking needs of    residents to ensure efficient parking solutions.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (2. Preserving and Enhancing Public Spaces: Contributing to the vibrancy of city life and supporting environmental initiatives through the enhancement of public spaces.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (3. Developing Amenities and Boosting City Revenue: Diversifying the tax base, attracting talent, and generating revenue by developing amenities that benefit the community.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (4. Redeveloping Impacted Land: Restoring native foliage, mitigating invasive species, and enhancing infrastructure on impacted land to promote sustainable development.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (5. Improving City Transportation Network: Enhancing the transportation network, diversifying transit modes, and managing airspace to improve overall connectivity and efficiency.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Additionally, the survey highlighted the importance of enhancing safety throughout the city, emphasizing the community's commitment to creating a secure environment for all residents. In an effort to further discover these goals with the community, a series of Facebook Live sessions will be conducted to discuss these priorities in detail. On these Facebook lives, we will discuss the current parking study that is underway, the open space master plan, the city's economic development strategy, and our recent transportation plan.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
