171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The city is dedicated to improving in each of these areas to keep Vineyard moving forward and enhance our quality of life. As we move forward with implementing these goals, the collective efforts of residents, city council, and stakeholders will play a crucial role in shaping a vibrant and sustainable future for our community. Together, we can work towards building a city that fulfills the needs and aspirations of our growing community.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
