194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The next session of our free parenting workshop, Guiding Good Choices begins on March 23rd! Guiding Good Choices is a 5 week course designed for parents of youth ages 9 to 14. Parenting partners are encouraged to attend together. The workshop is discussion based and focuses on helping families and youth navigate setting guidelines, avoiding trouble, managing conflict, and strengthening family bonds. Lunch and childcare are provided for all attendees. Each family that completes all five weeks will receive a gift valued at $100. Please register at https://www.vineyardcares.org/programs or email Jessica at jessicam@vineyardutah.org)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
