197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Vineyard Cares is looking for teen volunteers! We need youth involvement and help in planning and implementing prevention initiatives. Some of these events include a Children's Health Fair, Kindness Week, Red Ribbon Week, Guiding Good Choices Kid Care, city events, and the largest event is a family carnival event for Vineyard Days. Teens will help plan, prepare for, and "staff" events. This is a fun opportunity for youth to be involved in the community and also learn more about public health and prevention. Commitment requirements include attending meetings once a month and then helping the day of events. If you have questions please contact Jessica at 801.687.7705 or jessicam@vineyardutah.org.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
