>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Vineyard Cares is looking for volunteers to help with a family carnival event for Vineyard Days. We will need help planning, constructing, and operating carnival games at the event on May 29, 2024. This is a fun opportunity for families and youth to be involved in the community and also learn more about public health and prevention. If you are interested in receiving more information, please email Jessica at jessicam@vineyardutah.org.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
