214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Exciting news: VINEYARD CITY just earned the Bronze Bicycle Friendly Community award! The Bronze Bicycle Friendly Community award is a testament to a community's commitment to improving biking infrastructure, safety, and culture. Let's pedal towards safer roads and stronger communities together!  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
