/S /P
/ActualText (Exciting news! Our Public Works Utilities team has just finished lining three sewer manholes as part of our maintenance routine. These manholes were dealing with some extra wear and tear from sewer gases and groundwater, causing problems like increased costs for pumping and treatment. But don't worry, we've got it sorted!)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Besides giving these manholes a makeover, we also fixed some leaks, letting 20-30 gallons of stuff per minute seep in. That's a lot! Now, no more leaks, and everything's back in order.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Why do we care so much? We're dedicated to keeping our sewer system top-notch for you. This system does the heavy lifting, taking wastewater from homes and businesses to sewer treatment plants. It's all part of the big picture to keep our residents, like you, safe and our environment, like Utah Lake, clean for everyone's enjoyment.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
